      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where the results go — not into a commit",
      "prov:value": "So they are kept where every derived QA result is\nkept since arc `3fva` — the orphan **`qa-reports`** branch, keyed by the\ncommit they were computed on (`main/<sha>/`, `pr/<n>/<sha>/`), written by\n`bun run cat qa:publish` (the CI job `qa-publish`) and read back with `bun run\nqa:fetch`.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 3fva"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/authoring/content-lifecycle/content-test.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where the results go — not into a commit",
      "prov:value": "- **A certification** — an accountable decision taken on a plan's rollup —\n  also stays on `main`, beside the attestations (owner decision D5, default\n  (a)), and is then signed through\n  [`qa-report-signing`](../../../sdlc/skills/sdlc-core/qa-report-signing.md).",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/authoring/content-lifecycle/content-test.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Where the results go — not into a commit",
      "prov:value": "A test run's results are **derived**: re-running the plan over the same tree\nand data reproduces them. So they are kept where every derived QA result is\nkept since arc `3fva` — the orphan **`qa-reports`** branch, keyed by the\ncommit they were computed on (`main/<sha>/`, `pr/<n>/<sha>/`), written by\n`bun run cat qa:publish` (the CI job `qa-publish`) and read back with `bun run\nqa:fetch`. **Do not regenerate a results file in order to commit it**; the\ncheckout's `test/results/` is a working copy, still on `main` only until bean\n`5hox` removes it.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 5hox"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
